                                "sense_id": "d26f88de-ff90-3e13-93cc-bb14457de02a",
                                "text": "The geth models collectively dubbed \"hoppers\" by Alliance forces are electronic warfare platforms. They can project electromagnetic radiation across a broad spectrum as an offensive weapon. They can also perform cyber warfare attacks against the onboard computers of body armor hardsuits and weapons, adversely affecting their performance."
                            },
                            {
